volume: cowident - identify a window

# NAME

cowident - identify a window managed by cow

# SYNOPSIS

**cowident**

# DESCRIPTION

**cowident** shows properties about the selected window.

When invoked, **cowident** presents a fullscreen overlay with a crosshair
cursor. A window can be selected with the mouse.

# CANCELLATION

The targeting overlay can be dismissed without selecting a window by:

- pressing **Escape**;

- pressing the right or middle mouse button.

The cow window itself can be closed by clicking on the main window with the
mouse.

# SEE ALSO

**cow**(1), **moocow**(1), **cowpager**(1)

